# rule 16: a mode changed by name outside the owner (we_write.c).  The two
# of a user's files (Attributes, Ctrl-F9) went through wpe_write_set_perm and
# wpe_write_add_perm.  These are inside folders the editor made itself, 0700,
# on files it made a moment before; P2e moves them onto the owner's faces
# so that this list becomes empty.
we_debug.c|r16:e_d_script_write|1|P2e|the debugger script, in the editor's own 0700 folder
we_fl_unix.c|r16:e_ed_man|3|P2e|the man page's temporary output, in the editor's own 0700 folder
